#: src/TodoPage.qml:365
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome introduction text"
msgid ""
"<p>KomoDo is a To-Do list application that uses <a href='https://github.com/"
"todotxt/todo.txt'>todo.txt</a> rules.</p><p>The rules are fairly quick to "
"learn and KomoDo has help sections for it: <br>On the toolbar, click the "
"<i><interface>Help…</interface></i> button.<br>While editing a task, click "
"the <i><interface>Syntax Information…</interface></i> button.</p><p>You can "
"follow the rules as much or as little as you wish.<br> Feel free to "
"experiment to find out your ideal way of managing tasks.</p><p>Click "
"<i><interface>Open To-Do list…</interface></i> to use an existing list or "
"<i><interface>Create New To-Do list…</interface></i> to start a new list.</p>"
msgstr "<p>KomoDo je aplikacija za popise obveza koja koristi pravila <a href='https://github.com/todotxt/todo.txt'>todo.txt</a>.</p><p>Pravila je prilično lako naučiti, a KomoDo sadrži odjeljke pomoći: <br>Na alatnoj traci kliknite gumb <i><interface>Pomoć…</interface></i>.<br>Pri uređivanju zadatka kliknite gumb <i><interface>Informacije o sintaksi…</interface></i>.</p><p>Pravila možete slijediti koliko god želite.<br>Slobodno eksperimentirajte i pronađite idealan način upravljanja zadacima.</p><p>Kliknite <i><interface>Otvori popis obveza…</interface></i> za uporabu postojećeg popisa ili <i><interface>Stvori novi popis obveza…</interface></i> za stvaranje novog.</p>"

